sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Internal Staff / Founder
    participant GW as Fastify Gateway (:4000)
    participant Auth as RBAC / ABAC Guard
    participant Cache as Redis L1 / L2 Semantic Cache
    participant Router as Intent Classifier
    participant SQL as Deterministic SQL Engine
    participant RAG as pgvector Hybrid Retriever
    participant LLM as Model Tier (Flash / Pro)
    participant Out as Output PII Validator

    User->>GW: POST /api/query/stream { prompt: "How many packages yesterday?" }
    GW->>Auth: Validate JWT & User Roles (ROLE_FOUNDER)
    Auth-->>GW: OK (Identity context attached)
    
    GW->>Cache: Lookup SHA-256 & Semantic Similarity (>0.96)
    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>GW: Cached JSON Response (0.07ms)
        GW-->>User: Stream Cached Result via SSE
    else Cache Miss
        GW->>Router: Classify Intent & Entity Targets
        Router-->>GW: Route = DETERMINISTIC_SQL (Target = wms_db)
        
        GW->>SQL: Execute Golden SQL Template (Timezone-Aware)
        Note over SQL: Converts received_at AT TIME ZONE w.timezone<br/>Extracts exactly 103 packages (59 East, 44 West)
        SQL-->>GW: Structured Fact Record (103 pkgs, 4,812 units)
        
        opt Hybrid Synthesis Needed
            GW->>RAG: Retrieve SOP-WH-02 / Damage Policy Chunks
            RAG-->>GW: Relevant Context Chunks
        end
        
        GW->>LLM: Dispatch [Prompt + Reconciled Facts + SOP Context]
        LLM-->>GW: Formatted Natural Language Response
        
        GW->>Out: Scan Output for Accidental PII / System Delimiters
        Out-->>GW: Clean Verified Stream
        
        GW->>Cache: Store in L1 Redis + L2 Semantic Cache
        GW-->>User: SSE Chunked Markdown Stream
    end
